WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.377
The biggest and best
part of the intangible things

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:05.672
that I was able to take from
the military would have to be

00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:09.259
my drive
to continue for success.

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:12.804
My name is Devon Riley.

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:14.556
I'm an Air Force
veteran, having served

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:16.808
eight years in the world's
greatest Air Force.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.309
I am from New Haven,
Connecticut.

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:19.936
I've been able to work
in the Office

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:21.730
of Diversity and Inclusion,

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:25.275
and I've been able to serve
many different affinity groups.

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:27.861
To be a part of Yale's veteran
community feels really good.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:30.864
It's an opportunity to see
individuals who are leading

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:34.117
the way in different branches,
but as well as different units.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.744
We served and we've done
some of the things

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:37.537
at the highest level
that we possibly could.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.830
I try to live life that way.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:41.332
You realize
Veterans Day is a day for us.

00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:43.334
Do whatever you can to
make sure our community

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:46.004
still thrives, because it can be
a little tough.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:49.048
Always look out to other
veterans. We got your back.

